            "caption": "A cafe that feels like a calm little escape in J. P. Nagar. \u2615\u2728\n\nI visited Iris Cafe and Kitchen expecting a regular cafe experience, but it turned out to be so much better. \n\nThe vibe is relaxed and easygoing \u2014 the kind of place where you can sit for hours without feeling rushed. \ud83c\udf3f\n\nThe fish and chips were a real highlight: crispy fries, perfectly done fish, and a satisfying bite from start to finish. \ud83d\udc1f\ud83c\udf5f\n\nThe Pina Colada was smooth and refreshing, the fish cake felt light and clean on the palate, and the tiramisu disappeared way too fast. \ud83c\udf79\ud83c\udf70\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for a place with good food, a chill atmosphere, and dishes worth coming back for, Iris Cafe and Kitchen is definitely one to try. \ud83d\udc9b\n.\n.\n\ud83d\udccd Outlets:\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 HSR Layout \u2013 18th Cross Rd, Sector 3, Bengaluru \u2013 560102 | \ud83d\udcde 9035533248\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 J. P. Nagar \u2013 735, 16th Cross, 29th Main Rd, 6th Phase, Bengaluru \u2013 560078 | \ud83d\udcde 9353346502\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Jayanagar \u2013 554, 10th A Main, 36th Cross Rd, 4th Block, Bengaluru \u2013 560041 | \ud83d\udcde 9035533278\n.\n.\n#IrisCafeAndKitchen #JPNagar #CafeVibes #FishAndChips #PinaColada FishCake Tiramisu",
