            "caption": "Step into a vibe so aesthetic, you might forget you came to eat \u2728\ud83d\ude0d\n\nAt Iris Cafe and Kitchen, every corner is a mood and every plate is a masterpiece.\n\nFrom the perfectly balanced Lotus Stem Honey Chilli to the rich & indulgent Stuffed Mushroom Gratin \u2014 every bite hits different \ud83e\udd0c\ud83d\ude0b\n\nSip on dreamy drinks like the Hazelnut Frappe & Sunset, dive into classics like Arrabbiata & Paneer Fillet Steak, and end on a sweet note with creamy Tresleches \ud83c\udf78\ud83c\udf70\n\nGood food. Great vibes. Even better company.\n\n\ud83d\udccc Save this & tag your gang \u2014 your next hangout spot is sorted.\n.\n.\n\ud83d\udccd Outlets:\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 HSR Layout \u2013 18th Cross Rd, Sector 3, Bengaluru \u2013 560102 | \ud83d\udcde 9035533248\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 J. P. Nagar \u2013 735, 16th Cross, 29th Main Rd, 6th Phase, Bengaluru \u2013 560078 | \ud83d\udcde 9353346502\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Jayanagar \u2013 554, 10th A Main, 36th Cross Rd, 4th Block, Bengaluru \u2013 560041 | \ud83d\udcde 9035533278\n.\n.\n#IrisCafe #HSRLayoutEats #BangaloreCafes #CafeHopping #FoodieBangalore InstaCafe",
